1
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:03,160
All depicted events are fictional

2
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:06,360
and for entertainment purposes only.
Viewer discretion is advised.

3
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:21,800
My Lord,

4
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:23,120
the fault is mine alone.

5
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,840
I can wait no longer.

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,240
Uncle.

7
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:30,840
Can you escort me to my manor?

8
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,160
<i>How did we</i>

9
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:48,520
<i>get to know each other?</i>

10
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:52,040
I wasn't here to have fun?

11
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,000
No, Master.

12
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:57,440
You simply held me in fond regard.

13
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:05,440
<i>I can't concentrate at all.</i>

14
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:08,280
<i>Why is he constantly on my mind?</i>

15
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:30,920
Uncle, I can't handle a boat very well.
Can you escort me to my manor?

16
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:18,080
Phop,

17
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:20,560
I'm sorry.

18
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:27,120
I am relieved to know you are safe.

19
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,240
Pray, come inside.

20
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:41,040
Phop.

21
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,840
Phop!

22
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,720
<i>Even if he's mad,</i>

23
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:51,040
<i>he still acts nice, doesn't he?</i>

24
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:57,640
<i>If he insulted me like before,</i>
<i>I wouldn't feel this guilty.</i>

25
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,760
<i>How terrifying.</i>

26
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:05,040
<i>If my feelings for him grow even more,</i>

27
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:06,760
<i>what's going to happen?</i>

28
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:32,120
Master Klao!

29
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,520
Master Klao!

30
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,480
Master Klao.

31
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:37,040
Master, you are not recovered.
Pray, take some rest.

32
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,800
Kong, move.

33
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,960
I want to talk to Phop.

34
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,720
Lord Phop… He…

35
00:05:44,800 --> 00:05:45,960
He is on patrol, Master.

36
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:48,840
If so, then who are you waiting here for?

37
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:52,920
I am merely here to rest.

38
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:55,560
The breeze is most agreeable here.

39
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:10,200
Lord Phop requested you not visit.

40
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:13,280
He is gravely ill,
having been out in the rain all night.

41
00:06:13,360 --> 00:06:16,040
He fears you may also be taken ill by him.

42
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:34,920
My Master Klao, my little angel.

43
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:37,120
Pray, take a few bites for my sake.

44
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:39,920
These are all your favorites.

45
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:45,680
I have kept all chilies
from the kitchen today

46
00:06:45,760 --> 00:06:48,920
so that the dishes
are not in the least spicy.

47
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:59,520
If you desire something else,
pray tell me.

48
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:01,440
Deer, mouse-deer, Eld's deer,

49
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:04,240
elephants, turtles,
lice, fleas, or seashells?

50
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:06,040
Say but the word,

51
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:08,920
and I shall go and hunt it for you.

52
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,560
Oh, Muan,

53
00:07:10,640 --> 00:07:13,680
no soul takes pleasure in lice and fleas.

54
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:16,240
Good heavens.
Even Lord Phop has eaten termites.

55
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:56,960
Master Klao.

56
00:07:59,200 --> 00:08:00,160
Chuay!

57
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:18,800
And I was foolishly glad

58
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:21,760
to see Master Klao
smiling and laughing once more.

59
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:24,200
I hoped things would return
to the way they were.

60
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:27,640
What is your meaning in saying so?

61
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:30,000
When Master Klao returned from Phichit,

62
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:31,640
he seemed…

63
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:33,240
In those days,

64
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:35,600
he was in such high spirits.

65
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:39,360
Whenever he visited,

66
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:41,760
he would bring books for discussion.

67
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:44,920
Even the most complex
and difficult matters,

68
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:47,480
the two of them would discuss together,

69
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:50,640
as though they alone
in the world understood.

70
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,240
Aunt…

71
00:08:57,160 --> 00:09:00,080
He was well when he returned from Phichit,

72
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:05,360
but within a few months,
they fell to quarreling morning and night.

73
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:10,120
At times, they would grow sullen
and refuse to speak to one another.

74
00:09:13,080 --> 00:09:15,960
So you brought liquor into the manor,
though I forbade you?

75
00:09:16,040 --> 00:09:18,000
Do not give me cause to worry so, Klao!

76
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:20,080
I am truly weary of this!

77
00:09:26,160 --> 00:09:28,760
Then cease your worrying over me.

78
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:31,320
I shall not remain here any longer!

79
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:32,920
Chuay!

80
00:09:34,640 --> 00:09:36,720
Go and gather my belongings,

81
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:38,800
and move everything to the small manor.

82
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:43,480
Once the High Lord
returns from his official duties,

83
00:09:44,720 --> 00:09:46,800
I shall inform him of this matter.

84
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:51,120
Chuay!

85
00:09:52,040 --> 00:09:54,480
What are you dawdling for?

86
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:55,800
Now!

87
00:10:03,920 --> 00:10:06,280
<i>Master Klao has never</i>
<i>returned to the main manor.</i>

88
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:09,640
Rather than devote himself to his studies,

89
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,400
he took to idling away his days.

90
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:18,320
At first, I understood that
he was grieving for his father

91
00:10:18,400 --> 00:10:20,840
and needed some distraction.

92
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:26,320
But as time passed, it seemed he had
fallen into a life of heavy drinking.

93
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:30,200
At that time, Lord Phop was much
distressed on his account.

94
00:10:30,280 --> 00:10:32,520
Whenever Master Klao went out,

95
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,320
Lord Phop would neither eat

96
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:36,280
nor sleep in peace.

97
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:39,160
He would often secretly wait
at the small manor,

98
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:42,040
exposed to the elements
until he fell gravely ill.

99
00:10:44,920 --> 00:10:46,200
Worst of all,

100
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:50,360
they were still estranged
and not on speaking terms

101
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,840
until the very day

102
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:54,320
Master Klao disappeared.

103
00:10:58,600 --> 00:11:00,720
At times, I cannot help but feel that

104
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:04,120
his madness might actually be a blessing.

105
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:06,640
For all his strange and erratic speech,

106
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:09,880
it is better to have
forgotten the tragedies of the past.

107
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:14,440
The most heartwarming sight
was Master Klao and Lord Phop,

108
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:17,000
laughing and chatting as in days past.

109
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:21,080
But I never thought they would
come to quarrel again.

110
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:22,880
It is true.

111
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:34,600
I am so afraid,

112
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:38,320
for I fear they shall never speak again.

113
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:40,320
Or worst of all,

114
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:43,640
I fear Master Klao might vanish once more.

115
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:49,280
<i>Once before, I nearly lost</i>
<i>all that I held dear.</i>

116
00:11:50,760 --> 00:11:53,120
I know too well the agony it brings.

117
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:57,200
<i>I wish for such sorrow</i>
<i>never to strike again,</i>

118
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:00,960
<i>neither upon myself</i>

119
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:03,960
<i>nor upon my friend.</i>

120
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:38,200
What is the matter, Jom?

121
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:40,680
Why have you grown so quiet?

122
00:12:40,760 --> 00:12:42,280
Nothing.

123
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:44,400
But with you staring at me,

124
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,720
it is ruining my appetite.

125
00:12:53,880 --> 00:12:56,600
The other day,
you scolded me before everyone,

126
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:00,280
and now you treat me with such coldness.

127
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:04,680
I prepared your favorite meal,
hoping we might move past this,

128
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:13,280
but I regret ever coming here.

129
00:13:22,480 --> 00:13:23,880
Sit down, will you?

130
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:25,880
I have not yet said a word.

131
00:13:54,040 --> 00:13:55,640
I truly do not understand you.

132
00:13:57,560 --> 00:14:00,120
Is it so difficult to speak kindly to me?

133
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:03,720
In the past,

134
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:05,600
you used to protect me.

135
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:07,800
So why…

136
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:10,680
now that we have grown older,

137
00:14:10,760 --> 00:14:12,600
must you speak such cruel words?

138
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:22,280
Would you care for some cloth?

139
00:14:23,400 --> 00:14:25,720
-May I interest you in my fine cloth?
-Yes.

140
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:33,800
A cloth, sir?

141
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:36,480
What a dainty
and lovely little piece of cloth.

142
00:14:36,560 --> 00:14:41,200
The Farang use it to wipe away sweat,
and it is much favored indeed.

143
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:43,040
Would you like one?

144
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:47,400
This one

145
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:49,960
should suit a man like you best.

146
00:14:52,440 --> 00:14:55,960
I prefer soft and light shades
such as this one.

147
00:14:57,880 --> 00:14:58,760
I see.

148
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,200
His name is Kaew,

149
00:15:09,880 --> 00:15:12,360
the youngest son of
High Lord Sintaranurak.

150
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:14,760
His household has only sons.

151
00:15:14,840 --> 00:15:18,560
Kaew was an unexpected addition,
born long after the others.

152
00:15:19,280 --> 00:15:20,920
Word has it that

153
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:23,280
his mother raised her sons like daughters,

154
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:25,240
keeping them at home to do housework.

155
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:28,160
What a strange household they are.

156
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:30,520
Raising sons as though
they were daughters…

157
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:32,240
Have they no shame?

158
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:36,480
To have effeminate sons,
who would not feel ashamed?

159
00:15:50,040 --> 00:15:51,440
Kaew is a good man

160
00:15:51,520 --> 00:15:53,080
who conducts himself well.

161
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:56,080
Being close to his mother,
his nature is understandable.

162
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:58,280
Jom.

163
00:15:58,360 --> 00:16:00,000
And you should better know this,

164
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:03,640
High Lord Sintaranurak
has a kinsman within the palace walls,

165
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:07,280
a eunuch preacher,

166
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:08,880
who is higher in rank than you.

167
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:14,960
Jom, let us leave.

168
00:16:17,680 --> 00:16:19,080
<i>Whenever someone scolded me,</i>

169
00:16:20,040 --> 00:16:21,960
you were always the first to defend me.

170
00:16:24,520 --> 00:16:28,120
So why must you be the one
to hurt me like this?

171
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:37,560
Protecting one another, I see.

172
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:39,920
One might think you are husband and wife.

173
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:41,560
Or is it merely a little fling?

174
00:17:03,520 --> 00:17:04,920
Well…

175
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:09,240
I scold you, and no one else.

176
00:17:11,520 --> 00:17:13,160
But why?

177
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:17,560
I only see you as a younger brother.

178
00:17:20,560 --> 00:17:21,880
But why?

179
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:29,880
Because…

180
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:34,360
we're childhood--

181
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:35,800
Not true.

182
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:40,760
You do not scold Klao as you do me.

183
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:43,200
He too is our childhood friend.

184
00:17:44,880 --> 00:17:46,120
Jom.

185
00:17:47,280 --> 00:17:49,400
At times you push me away,

186
00:17:50,520 --> 00:17:52,440
yet at times you are so kind to me.

187
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:57,440
How do you truly feel about me?

188
00:18:13,080 --> 00:18:14,680
I treasure you.

189
00:18:17,080 --> 00:18:19,320
You are my only companion.

190
00:18:20,280 --> 00:18:21,600
You bring me water

191
00:18:22,800 --> 00:18:24,080
and food

192
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:27,280
and assist me in every way.

193
00:18:30,080 --> 00:18:32,640
I must be strict with you at times,

194
00:18:33,160 --> 00:18:35,120
but only to prepare you for this world.

195
00:18:36,640 --> 00:18:38,160
So you may support yourself

196
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:45,520
and remain safe
from the malice and gossip of others.

197
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:48,880
Jom…

198
00:18:50,520 --> 00:18:52,120
I also

199
00:18:54,040 --> 00:18:55,920
have only you as my companion.

200
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:00,080
Physician!

201
00:20:00,160 --> 00:20:02,400
Are you here at present?

202
00:20:06,840 --> 00:20:09,200
Leave. I have patients to attend to.

203
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:12,200
-But Jom--
-Leave at once.

204
00:20:14,040 --> 00:20:16,520
Just a moment! I am coming down!

205
00:20:19,200 --> 00:20:21,040
I see you only as a younger brother.

206
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:23,480
Do not do such a thing again.

207
00:21:32,840 --> 00:21:34,160
Wrong time…

208
00:21:34,720 --> 00:21:36,680
Wrong circumstances.

209
00:21:37,880 --> 00:21:40,040
Restore what's lost and right all wrongs.

210
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:44,000
No.

211
00:21:44,880 --> 00:21:46,120
My father is innocent.

212
00:21:48,760 --> 00:21:49,760
Good heavens.

213
00:21:51,240 --> 00:21:52,360
Master Klao.

214
00:22:00,200 --> 00:22:01,400
My Lord?

215
00:22:01,480 --> 00:22:02,760
Are you quite well now?

216
00:22:04,520 --> 00:22:05,800
Quiet.

217
00:22:27,080 --> 00:22:28,480
Has he been this way long?

218
00:22:33,320 --> 00:22:34,880
Earlier today,

219
00:22:34,960 --> 00:22:36,160
he was well, my Lord.

220
00:22:38,680 --> 00:22:39,800
But…

221
00:22:41,640 --> 00:22:42,960
What is it?

222
00:22:48,920 --> 00:22:50,120
Master Klao

223
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:53,200
rose at dawn to see you.

224
00:22:55,080 --> 00:22:58,320
He had been out in the scorching sun,
watching over you all day

225
00:22:58,400 --> 00:22:59,800
without food, my Lord.

226
00:23:00,480 --> 00:23:03,640
By evening, he began to lapse
into delirium, as you see.

227
00:23:20,640 --> 00:23:22,080
He is very hot to the touch.

228
00:23:26,560 --> 00:23:28,000
Go and fetch a damp cloth.

229
00:23:28,680 --> 00:23:30,400
Tell the servants in the kitchen

230
00:23:30,480 --> 00:23:32,800
to prepare a batch of herbal medicine.

231
00:23:36,120 --> 00:23:37,040
Go now.

232
00:23:37,800 --> 00:23:38,800
Yes, my Lord.

233
00:23:57,040 --> 00:23:58,160
Forgive me.

234
00:24:00,040 --> 00:24:02,880
I shall never again treat you so coldly.

235
00:25:08,600 --> 00:25:09,760
Home…

236
00:25:11,760 --> 00:25:12,840
I want to go home.

237
00:25:35,080 --> 00:25:36,480
Fear not,

238
00:25:42,320 --> 00:25:44,360
for I shall be your home.

239
00:26:51,440 --> 00:26:52,440
<i>Two rounds</i>

240
00:26:53,200 --> 00:26:54,440
of the lash.

241
00:26:56,120 --> 00:26:57,240
Father!

242
00:26:58,920 --> 00:27:00,040
Father!

243
00:27:00,120 --> 00:27:00,960
Klao!

244
00:27:07,040 --> 00:27:08,120
Cease this!

245
00:27:09,080 --> 00:27:10,880
My father is guiltless!

246
00:27:12,000 --> 00:27:14,400
Restrain yourself,

247
00:27:14,480 --> 00:27:15,960
lest you too face punishment.

248
00:27:18,360 --> 00:27:20,440
He is guiltless!

249
00:27:20,520 --> 00:27:23,920
If you seek his life, take mine instead!

250
00:27:27,800 --> 00:27:29,400
Consider your father.

251
00:27:30,080 --> 00:27:31,960
How would he feel hearing this?

252
00:27:37,280 --> 00:27:39,400
My father commits no foul deeds.

253
00:27:42,920 --> 00:27:44,600
He bears ill will toward no one.

254
00:27:46,760 --> 00:27:49,080
My father is being wrongly accused!

255
00:27:52,760 --> 00:27:53,920
Dear Klao.

256
00:27:54,760 --> 00:27:57,000
Act with prudence.

257
00:28:05,640 --> 00:28:07,800
Prudence be damned!

258
00:28:09,280 --> 00:28:11,080
I care only

259
00:28:11,640 --> 00:28:13,760
to find

260
00:28:14,320 --> 00:28:15,840
every soul

261
00:28:15,920 --> 00:28:18,240
who bore false witness against my father!

262
00:28:19,120 --> 00:28:21,440
And they shall meet their end

263
00:28:21,520 --> 00:28:24,240
by my hand!

264
00:28:24,320 --> 00:28:25,720
-Unhand me!
-Klao!

265
00:28:30,560 --> 00:28:31,760
<i>Stay away from me!</i>

266
00:28:35,960 --> 00:28:37,240
Steady yourself, Klao.

267
00:28:37,320 --> 00:28:38,760
If Cherd slanders your father,

268
00:28:38,840 --> 00:28:40,840
will His Excellency would believe him

269
00:28:40,920 --> 00:28:41,960
being but a commoner?

270
00:28:42,040 --> 00:28:44,200
Confronting him will court greater danger.

271
00:28:45,200 --> 00:28:46,560
I care not!

272
00:28:46,640 --> 00:28:49,840
I must hunt down whosoever
bore false witness against my father!

273
00:28:59,040 --> 00:29:00,280
Hey!

274
00:29:04,840 --> 00:29:08,240
So you brought liquor into the manor,
though I forbade you?

275
00:29:10,480 --> 00:29:12,880
Do not give me cause to worry so, Klao!

276
00:29:12,960 --> 00:29:14,400
I am truly weary of this!

277
00:29:56,120 --> 00:29:57,680
<i>Klao suspected Cherd,</i>

278
00:29:58,640 --> 00:30:00,040
<i>so he confronted him.</i>

279
00:30:00,560 --> 00:30:01,800
<i>It wasn't just about Pim.</i>

280
00:30:02,520 --> 00:30:05,360
<i>I don't know whether</i>
<i>he framed Lord Preechaphibal,</i>

281
00:30:05,440 --> 00:30:07,680
<i>but he may have killed Klao.</i>

282
00:30:09,520 --> 00:30:10,640
Klao?

283
00:30:13,600 --> 00:30:15,680
<i>He thought Klao was dead.</i>

284
00:30:16,200 --> 00:30:19,560
<i>Klao should've died,</i>
<i>as the fortune teller said.</i>

285
00:30:19,640 --> 00:30:21,920
<i>However, I was placed in Klao's place,</i>

286
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:24,400
<i>that's why Cherd looked like</i>
<i>he'd seen a ghost.</i>

287
00:30:27,320 --> 00:30:28,800
<i>Cherd is a troublemaker.</i>

288
00:30:28,880 --> 00:30:31,360
<i>Even if Phop doesn't know Klao's fate,</i>

289
00:30:31,440 --> 00:30:33,120
<i>it's natural he'd be worried.</i>

290
00:30:36,760 --> 00:30:40,280
<i>Phop has loved you</i>
<i>all this time, Klao.</i>

291
00:30:45,120 --> 00:30:45,960
Master Klao.

292
00:30:47,320 --> 00:30:48,440
Are you improved?

293
00:30:54,160 --> 00:30:56,120
You must've stayed by my side all night.

294
00:30:57,000 --> 00:30:58,560
Thank you, Chuay.

295
00:31:00,080 --> 00:31:02,080
Why did you thank me, Master?

296
00:31:02,160 --> 00:31:04,440
It is Lord Phop you should thank.

297
00:31:48,000 --> 00:31:50,640
Did I wake you?

298
00:31:52,400 --> 00:31:56,760
I have been awake for some time,
but have not regained my strength.

299
00:32:06,880 --> 00:32:08,200
You're still burning up.

300
00:32:08,880 --> 00:32:10,400
Do take the herbal medicine.

301
00:32:31,280 --> 00:32:32,960
I can manage on my own.

302
00:32:35,360 --> 00:32:37,200
You're still sick. Don't act so tough.

303
00:32:38,040 --> 00:32:39,640
You also take care of me.

304
00:32:39,720 --> 00:32:41,360
Let me return the favor.

305
00:32:52,120 --> 00:32:53,160
Bitter…

306
00:32:56,480 --> 00:32:57,720
I thought so.

307
00:32:58,560 --> 00:33:01,080
Muan prepared me for this.

308
00:33:12,080 --> 00:33:13,680
ICHITAN GREEN TEA

309
00:33:34,440 --> 00:33:37,360
It gets rid of the bitterness
and your fussiness.

310
00:34:15,639 --> 00:34:16,679
I…

311
00:34:17,639 --> 00:34:19,400
I'm sorry

312
00:34:20,120 --> 00:34:21,120
for…

313
00:34:21,679 --> 00:34:24,080
making you worry about me.

314
00:34:26,080 --> 00:34:27,600
I too am sorry

315
00:34:28,679 --> 00:34:30,440
for being harsh on you.

316
00:34:32,560 --> 00:34:35,800
-I did it out of--
-Concern?

317
00:34:36,600 --> 00:34:38,120
I get it now.

318
00:34:38,760 --> 00:34:41,080
If I were to go anywhere,

319
00:34:41,159 --> 00:34:43,520
I'd tell you everything.

320
00:34:43,600 --> 00:34:44,719
Okay?

321
00:36:03,200 --> 00:36:04,520
He has fallen asleep.

322
00:36:04,600 --> 00:36:06,040
Please get some rest.

323
00:36:06,120 --> 00:36:08,520
I shall go and fetch some books.

324
00:36:08,600 --> 00:36:11,640
I'll be back. See you in the evening!

325
00:36:16,160 --> 00:36:17,320
I know nothing.

326
00:36:17,400 --> 00:36:18,600
When did you arrive?

327
00:36:18,680 --> 00:36:20,040
What is this clutter?

328
00:36:20,120 --> 00:36:21,440
Sai, why must you push me?

329
00:36:56,280 --> 00:36:58,960
<i>There's got to be something in that book.</i>

330
00:37:06,880 --> 00:37:08,720
What is it that you seek, Master?

331
00:37:08,800 --> 00:37:11,080
Everything has
been moved to the main manor.

332
00:37:11,960 --> 00:37:12,960
Chuay.

333
00:37:13,520 --> 00:37:15,240
Have you ever seen me

334
00:37:15,320 --> 00:37:17,680
write something down?

335
00:37:17,760 --> 00:37:21,560
Something that feels very personal,

336
00:37:21,640 --> 00:37:22,640
describing my life.

337
00:37:23,200 --> 00:37:24,760
Why not inquire sooner, Master?

338
00:37:37,280 --> 00:37:38,880
It is this one that you seek.

339
00:37:38,960 --> 00:37:41,520
You used it to steady the wobbly bed.

340
00:37:41,600 --> 00:37:44,320
But it was too thin for its purpose.

341
00:38:16,280 --> 00:38:17,880
<i>He loved writing notes.</i>

342
00:38:17,960 --> 00:38:19,320
<i>Just like me.</i>

343
00:38:27,600 --> 00:38:29,840
Chuay, can you read any of this?

344
00:38:29,920 --> 00:38:34,320
You wrote it this way
so that it would be illegible to me.

345
00:38:39,960 --> 00:38:43,480
<i>He wrote it so no one</i>
<i>could read it, as I've been doing?</i>

346
00:38:44,800 --> 00:38:46,200
<i>This must be important then.</i>

347
00:39:03,680 --> 00:39:05,840
FIVE DAYS LATER

348
00:39:14,240 --> 00:39:17,680
<i>It's been a week, but all I can decipher</i>
<i>is "second period."</i>

349
00:39:17,760 --> 00:39:21,280
<i>Chuay says the second period</i>
<i>is 10:00 p.m. to 2:00 a.m.</i>

350
00:39:22,400 --> 00:39:24,360
<i>What would he be doing at 2:00 a.m.?</i>

351
00:39:26,080 --> 00:39:27,840
<i>My head's gonna explode!</i>

352
00:39:27,920 --> 00:39:29,120
<i>Why does an English major</i>

353
00:39:29,200 --> 00:39:31,480
<i>use ancient Thai, Khom, and Pali scripts?</i>

354
00:39:39,160 --> 00:39:40,040
Klao.

355
00:39:40,760 --> 00:39:42,960
Should you be awake, step outside.

356
00:39:43,040 --> 00:39:45,160
In but two days, Songkran shall arrive.

357
00:39:46,400 --> 00:39:48,440
Our manor is filled with merriment.

358
00:39:52,760 --> 00:39:54,320
Understood.

359
00:40:08,960 --> 00:40:10,240
Every Songkran,

360
00:40:10,320 --> 00:40:12,360
our relatives, kin,

361
00:40:12,440 --> 00:40:15,520
and elders gather
to pay their respects to my father.

362
00:40:15,600 --> 00:40:18,200
Thus, we must prepare
for hundreds to arrive.

363
00:40:21,440 --> 00:40:24,040
You have visited us.
Surely you recall, do you not?

364
00:40:32,760 --> 00:40:34,000
Bud.

365
00:40:41,080 --> 00:40:42,480
I see you finally came.

366
00:40:44,320 --> 00:40:46,080
Everyone is busy with preparations.

367
00:40:46,920 --> 00:40:49,760
I am surprised
you did not remain in bed, Klao.

368
00:40:49,840 --> 00:40:52,800
Oh, Bud, be not so harsh on our boy.

369
00:40:52,880 --> 00:40:54,560
He is still unwell.

370
00:41:02,320 --> 00:41:04,120
You are indeed talented, Master Kaew.

371
00:41:04,200 --> 00:41:06,200
Your arrangements are exquisite,

372
00:41:06,280 --> 00:41:08,320
and your cuisine is superb.

373
00:41:19,480 --> 00:41:20,840
Kaew, you're here as well?

374
00:41:41,040 --> 00:41:44,680
From that moment on,
he shunned my presence

375
00:41:46,280 --> 00:41:48,280
and barred me from his manor.

376
00:41:49,760 --> 00:41:52,000
How cruel and heartless.

377
00:41:55,680 --> 00:41:58,760
Doing things for someone you love
is good,

378
00:41:59,680 --> 00:42:02,520
but you also need to love yourself.

379
00:42:26,440 --> 00:42:27,840
With beauty like this,

380
00:42:28,360 --> 00:42:29,920
had this been Phichit,

381
00:42:30,800 --> 00:42:32,600
the city would have fallen for you.

382
00:42:38,600 --> 00:42:40,720
If you love yourself

383
00:42:40,800 --> 00:42:42,480
and believe in your qualities,

384
00:42:43,120 --> 00:42:45,680
one day he'll notice them.

385
00:42:46,360 --> 00:42:49,160
But if he doesn't, just forget about him.

386
00:42:51,360 --> 00:42:52,480
I believe that

387
00:42:52,560 --> 00:42:55,720
you'll eventually find
the love you deserve.

388
00:43:24,680 --> 00:43:25,960
Songkran is almost here,

389
00:43:28,080 --> 00:43:30,080
shall we go do something fun?

390
00:43:35,240 --> 00:43:36,240
Phop.

391
00:43:36,920 --> 00:43:38,160
Can you call Chuay for me?

392
00:43:57,560 --> 00:43:59,120
I ask for your blessing.

393
00:44:04,400 --> 00:44:05,680
May you find solace.

394
00:44:05,760 --> 00:44:07,560
-May you live long…
-Pray, a blessing.

395
00:44:07,640 --> 00:44:09,680
-…and in good health.
-May you prosper.

396
00:44:09,760 --> 00:44:12,280
Whoa, awesome.

397
00:44:12,360 --> 00:44:14,120
It feels like an Ayutthaya fan meet.

398
00:44:17,920 --> 00:44:20,280
There's even a hi-touch.

399
00:44:21,000 --> 00:44:22,600
It really is touching.

400
00:44:22,680 --> 00:44:24,560
Touching their foreheads.

401
00:44:25,280 --> 00:44:27,000
May you find solace in this land.

402
00:44:30,160 --> 00:44:32,000
It's really bustling here.

403
00:44:33,520 --> 00:44:38,000
Not as lively as
Khao San Road or Silom though.

404
00:44:40,720 --> 00:44:42,880
People here don't splash water?

405
00:44:45,600 --> 00:44:48,160
This is Songkran, Klao, not a wedding.

406
00:44:48,240 --> 00:44:49,720
Why would there be water?

407
00:44:51,120 --> 00:44:54,120
<i>Oh, so splashing water at each other</i>
<i>isn't a thing in this era.</i>

408
00:44:54,200 --> 00:44:55,840
<i>So it's just a ceremony, right?</i>

409
00:45:13,320 --> 00:45:16,040
I reckon the crowd won't thin
till midday, Klao.

410
00:45:16,120 --> 00:45:17,880
Let us go to the temple.

411
00:45:18,680 --> 00:45:21,440
Sure. Pay respects and make a wish.

412
00:45:22,040 --> 00:45:24,160
Maybe this will make Jom go

413
00:45:24,800 --> 00:45:26,240
a bit softer on you.

414
00:45:31,080 --> 00:45:33,600
Come on, Chuay, Sai, and Kong.

415
00:45:33,680 --> 00:45:35,160
Let's go to the temple.

416
00:45:35,240 --> 00:45:36,640
Master Klao,

417
00:45:36,720 --> 00:45:40,680
may I powder Lord Phop's face
before we proceed?

418
00:45:41,200 --> 00:45:42,680
Sai, what has gotten into you?

419
00:45:42,760 --> 00:45:43,880
Well, this is Songkran.

420
00:45:48,640 --> 00:45:50,800
Making merit to welcome the New Year.

421
00:45:50,880 --> 00:45:53,360
May you weep no more.
May only happiness find you.

422
00:45:54,360 --> 00:45:55,240
Klao.

423
00:45:56,560 --> 00:45:57,560
Master Klao.

424
00:45:58,800 --> 00:46:00,760
-Sai.
-Klao, wait for me.

425
00:46:02,880 --> 00:46:03,880
Make haste.

426
00:46:09,840 --> 00:46:14,080
May these precious walls of stone

427
00:46:14,160 --> 00:46:15,720
bring you great fortune

428
00:46:15,800 --> 00:46:19,880
and triumph.

429
00:46:20,680 --> 00:46:21,520
Fortune teller!

430
00:46:24,440 --> 00:46:25,880
It is you again, young man.

431
00:46:25,960 --> 00:46:27,880
Today is a fine day.

432
00:46:27,960 --> 00:46:29,240
I have a gift for you.

433
00:46:29,880 --> 00:46:31,160
Hold out your hand,

434
00:46:31,240 --> 00:46:33,960
for this gift is yours to cherish.

435
00:46:36,560 --> 00:46:38,720
Klao, do you know her?

436
00:46:38,800 --> 00:46:40,760
Rumor has it she is quite mad.

437
00:46:42,480 --> 00:46:44,720
It's okay. She's a kind soul.

438
00:46:45,600 --> 00:46:48,280
A madman meets a deranged soul.

439
00:46:48,360 --> 00:46:51,080
Will they make such a scene again?

440
00:46:54,240 --> 00:46:55,640
Fortune teller…

441
00:46:55,720 --> 00:46:58,160
I dreamed about Klao.

442
00:46:59,840 --> 00:47:03,800
He was actually killed, as you said.

443
00:47:04,400 --> 00:47:07,600
If I can find out who the murderer is,

444
00:47:07,680 --> 00:47:09,000
will I get to return home?

445
00:47:10,280 --> 00:47:11,280
Hold out your hand.

446
00:47:12,880 --> 00:47:14,720
I have something for you.

447
00:47:22,480 --> 00:47:25,080
A new soul dwells within this guise.

448
00:47:25,160 --> 00:47:26,320
A promise has been made.

449
00:47:28,080 --> 00:47:32,520
Fulfill the promise, restore what was
lost, and set wrongs aright.

450
00:47:43,520 --> 00:47:46,240
A star shard from the heavens.

451
00:47:47,320 --> 00:47:49,560
Keep it with you, young man.

452
00:47:49,640 --> 00:47:51,800
Pray with all your heart,

453
00:47:51,880 --> 00:47:55,400
and your prayers shall be answered.

454
00:47:59,120 --> 00:48:01,720
She has completely lost her wits.

455
00:48:01,800 --> 00:48:03,440
Let us leave, Klao.

456
00:48:04,160 --> 00:48:05,600
The crowd is staring.

457
00:48:10,200 --> 00:48:11,440
Give me a moment.

458
00:48:11,520 --> 00:48:13,040
I need to talk to her.

459
00:48:14,000 --> 00:48:18,160
Can you say that more simply?

460
00:48:18,240 --> 00:48:19,360
Oracle! Leave at once!

461
00:48:19,440 --> 00:48:20,640
Cause no trouble there!

462
00:48:20,720 --> 00:48:23,280
I shall take my leave.
We shall meet again.

463
00:48:23,360 --> 00:48:24,920
Don't go.

464
00:48:25,760 --> 00:48:26,960
We shall meet again.

465
00:48:27,040 --> 00:48:28,280
-Hey!
-This is Songkran!

466
00:48:28,360 --> 00:48:29,760
Be gone!

467
00:48:29,840 --> 00:48:31,000
I shall now depart.

468
00:48:32,080 --> 00:48:33,240
-It is time.
-Hey!

469
00:48:33,320 --> 00:48:35,720
Don't chase her away.
She's not a bad person.

470
00:48:35,800 --> 00:48:38,600
Master Klao, I beg of you,
do not speak with her.

471
00:48:38,680 --> 00:48:39,800
Hey, make haste!

472
00:48:41,520 --> 00:48:43,000
No.

473
00:48:43,080 --> 00:48:45,040
I wasn't done talking to her.

474
00:48:45,120 --> 00:48:46,200
Master Klao.

475
00:48:46,280 --> 00:48:49,200
Should you vanish again,
Lord Phop would grieve.

476
00:49:04,760 --> 00:49:06,160
Klao.

477
00:49:07,120 --> 00:49:09,840
It would seem you care greatly
for the oracle.

478
00:49:09,920 --> 00:49:11,000
Do you know her?

479
00:49:12,400 --> 00:49:14,800
Well, I've met her once or twice.

480
00:49:16,480 --> 00:49:18,480
But I…

481
00:49:18,560 --> 00:49:21,000
I don't like her being judged like that,

482
00:49:23,720 --> 00:49:26,440
the way Klao is the subject of gossip.

483
00:49:26,520 --> 00:49:28,160
I mean…

484
00:49:28,800 --> 00:49:30,320
like how they gossip about me.

485
00:49:31,160 --> 00:49:35,880
Being called a drunkard despite people
having no idea what I've been through.

486
00:49:39,000 --> 00:49:41,720
The same goes for
how they gossip about you,

487
00:49:45,640 --> 00:49:46,800
saying you like men

488
00:49:54,520 --> 00:49:56,520
even though they don't know

489
00:49:58,360 --> 00:50:00,440
how painful it is for you.

490
00:50:13,040 --> 00:50:15,440
No one ever truly knows who we are.

491
00:50:16,320 --> 00:50:18,040
All they know is gossip.

492
00:50:24,560 --> 00:50:25,560
Just because…

493
00:50:26,520 --> 00:50:28,280
we're different from others

494
00:50:29,960 --> 00:50:31,560
doesn't mean we're bad.

495
00:50:52,400 --> 00:50:55,240
If Jom had actually understood this

496
00:50:56,960 --> 00:50:59,000
and cared less about what others think,

497
00:51:01,120 --> 00:51:03,000
things would easier, right?

498
00:51:30,440 --> 00:51:32,040
Make a wish, Kaew.

499
00:51:34,360 --> 00:51:36,720
This is but a rock.

500
00:51:36,800 --> 00:51:39,040
Such a kind can be found along the river.

501
00:51:41,920 --> 00:51:45,160
Sometimes, ordinary things

502
00:51:45,960 --> 00:51:47,560
may grant you something special.

503
00:51:48,720 --> 00:51:50,760
There's no harm in trying, is there?

504
00:52:27,640 --> 00:52:28,800
May you find solace.

505
00:52:45,560 --> 00:52:46,920
What a relief this is.

506
00:52:47,600 --> 00:52:50,080
With all that racket,

507
00:52:50,200 --> 00:52:52,480
I thought you had run off with the oracle.

508
00:52:54,800 --> 00:52:56,200
A promise

509
00:52:56,280 --> 00:52:58,080
is a promise, is it not?

510
00:52:59,600 --> 00:53:02,480
May I pour scented water over your hands

511
00:53:03,200 --> 00:53:04,600
and receive your blessing?

512
00:53:05,240 --> 00:53:07,400
You ask as though I were your elder.

513
00:53:08,640 --> 00:53:12,080
Well, you're my brother after all.

514
00:53:16,760 --> 00:53:17,640
Excuse me.

515
00:53:17,720 --> 00:53:20,440
May I jump the queue

516
00:53:20,520 --> 00:53:24,160
and pour scented water
over his hands first?

517
00:53:24,240 --> 00:53:25,840
Jump?

518
00:53:27,480 --> 00:53:28,760
Why must he jump?

519
00:53:50,160 --> 00:53:51,720
May you find solace.

520
00:53:52,920 --> 00:53:53,920
Sadhu.

521
00:53:57,840 --> 00:53:58,840
Why wait?

522
00:53:59,520 --> 00:54:01,480
Have you forgotten how to pour water?

523
00:54:01,560 --> 00:54:03,560
I haven't, of course.

524
00:54:03,640 --> 00:54:06,120
But may I pour it

525
00:54:06,200 --> 00:54:09,240
the Phichit way?

526
00:54:28,400 --> 00:54:30,720
How could you dare treat me so?

527
00:54:37,080 --> 00:54:38,320
You really did it, huh?

528
00:54:38,400 --> 00:54:40,040
How dare you do that to me?

529
00:54:43,640 --> 00:54:44,520
Take that.

530
00:54:46,240 --> 00:54:47,280
Klao!

531
00:55:48,920 --> 00:55:49,880
I bid you farewell.

532
00:55:59,480 --> 00:56:00,600
Jom.

533
00:56:02,600 --> 00:56:04,840
May I have a little fun
and do as Klao did?

534
00:56:07,720 --> 00:56:09,560
I must tend to the sick,

535
00:56:10,080 --> 00:56:11,600
so I cannot get wet.

536
00:56:13,640 --> 00:56:16,720
In that case, may I pour scented water
over your hands?

537
00:56:16,800 --> 00:56:18,080
Over your feet will do.

538
00:56:19,840 --> 00:56:20,840
Very well.

539
00:56:21,520 --> 00:56:23,600
You may join Klao once you have finished.

540
00:57:57,280 --> 00:57:59,240
I shall be back.

541
00:58:01,840 --> 00:58:03,320
Jom…

542
00:58:09,200 --> 00:58:10,920
Jom.

543
00:58:11,000 --> 00:58:12,320
Where are you off to?

544
00:58:12,960 --> 00:58:14,960
We must have a proper word first.

545
00:58:15,040 --> 00:58:16,040
Jom.

546
00:58:17,880 --> 00:58:19,920
How much more plainly must I speak?

547
00:58:21,800 --> 00:58:23,400
If you behave so,

548
00:58:24,200 --> 00:58:27,280
people will talk
and no longer think you a gentleman.

549
00:58:30,920 --> 00:58:32,040
I do not care,

550
00:58:32,680 --> 00:58:33,960
so why should you?

551
00:58:35,000 --> 00:58:37,000
If you had no need
to care for anyone else,

552
00:58:38,480 --> 00:58:40,600
and if there were
no one else in this world,

553
00:58:41,800 --> 00:58:43,480
would you treat me differently?

554
00:58:44,680 --> 00:58:45,840
I have spoken plainly.

555
00:58:47,560 --> 00:58:49,160
I see you only as a brother.

556
00:58:50,080 --> 00:58:51,520
I could never feel otherwise.

557
00:58:53,440 --> 00:58:54,920
Do not trouble me further.

558
00:58:58,200 --> 00:59:00,200
Never once have I felt

559
00:59:00,280 --> 00:59:01,640
any affection for you.

560
00:59:19,640 --> 00:59:21,720
I ought not to have fallen for you.

561
00:59:26,440 --> 00:59:28,800
In the next life,

562
00:59:40,400 --> 00:59:42,920
I hope you will be the one to fall for me.

563
00:59:44,960 --> 00:59:46,560
When that time comes,

564
00:59:48,160 --> 00:59:50,800
I shall not look upon you.

565
01:00:47,720 --> 01:00:50,280
All your eccentricities

566
01:00:50,360 --> 01:00:52,000
appear to stem from Phichit.

567
01:00:53,440 --> 01:00:55,920
I am tempted to travel there,

568
01:00:56,960 --> 01:00:58,840
if only to discover the truth.

569
01:01:09,760 --> 01:01:12,720
Being struck with that water gun

570
01:01:13,360 --> 01:01:14,800
felt like a blow from a cane.

571
01:01:15,920 --> 01:01:17,800
Truly unsuitable for children's play.

572
01:01:18,720 --> 01:01:20,760
A stray shot to the eye

573
01:01:21,280 --> 01:01:23,040
could cause serious injury.

574
01:01:26,520 --> 01:01:29,920
I'll have Chuay burn all the water guns.

575
01:02:01,040 --> 01:02:03,320
Are you concerned for Kaew and Jom?

576
01:02:07,960 --> 01:02:11,560
I'm simply wondering
where they're squabbling now.

577
01:02:16,080 --> 01:02:17,840
If they quarrel, they can reconcile.

578
01:02:18,840 --> 01:02:20,400
Just as we do.

579
01:02:24,400 --> 01:02:26,160
Give Jom some time alone,

580
01:02:26,880 --> 01:02:28,280
and he will feel better.

581
01:03:05,000 --> 01:03:06,000
It is true, Cherd.

582
01:03:06,680 --> 01:03:08,880
Klao has been acting most strangely.

583
01:03:08,960 --> 01:03:10,760
He has ceased his outbursts

584
01:03:10,840 --> 01:03:13,400
and now laughs with Lord Phop,
unlike before.

585
01:03:15,040 --> 01:03:17,040
They say he suffers from amnesia.

586
01:03:17,120 --> 01:03:18,760
He visited the House of Pleasure.

587
01:03:18,840 --> 01:03:20,720
I was there.

588
01:03:21,480 --> 01:03:23,280
He could remember neither Sopha

589
01:03:23,360 --> 01:03:24,800
nor the others.

590
01:03:32,520 --> 01:03:34,120
Yet he went there to see Pim,

591
01:03:35,640 --> 01:03:37,600
as though he were trying to vex me.

592
01:03:37,680 --> 01:03:39,080
His amnesia is but a facade.

593
01:03:42,680 --> 01:03:44,400
He would scarce deceive his family.

594
01:03:45,040 --> 01:03:46,640
His taste in food has changed,

595
01:03:46,720 --> 01:03:51,160
and he now resides in the main manor,
which he once refused to do.

596
01:03:54,960 --> 01:03:55,880
Who told you so?

597
01:03:57,360 --> 01:04:00,840
Someone at Lord Phop's manor
told me all this.

598
01:04:12,520 --> 01:04:16,160
I truly believe
Master Klao suffers from amnesia.

599
01:04:17,280 --> 01:04:20,360
How could that be possible?

600
01:04:20,440 --> 01:04:24,280
Can amnesia change a man so much?

601
01:04:24,360 --> 01:04:25,920
I think not.

602
01:04:26,000 --> 01:04:28,960
Klao must have a twin brother.

603
01:04:29,040 --> 01:04:32,640
How could such a thing be possible,
Master?

604
01:04:32,720 --> 01:04:35,440
Of course it is possible.

605
01:04:36,480 --> 01:04:37,600
Listen closely.

606
01:04:37,680 --> 01:04:40,680
Klao disappeared.

607
01:04:40,760 --> 01:04:43,480
His twin has assumed his guise,

608
01:04:43,560 --> 01:04:47,680
posing as Klao to uncover

609
01:04:47,760 --> 01:04:49,760
the one who killed him.

610
01:04:50,840 --> 01:04:52,320
That gave me the creeps.

611
01:04:52,400 --> 01:04:53,960
Master, you are full of it.

612
01:04:54,040 --> 01:04:55,760
I am not.

613
01:04:55,840 --> 01:04:57,720
It is true.

614
01:04:57,800 --> 01:05:00,920
Consider this. If that were truly Klao,

615
01:05:01,000 --> 01:05:02,600
would he not remember everything?

616
01:05:02,680 --> 01:05:07,280
He once overturned the tables
and threw a terrible tantrum.

617
01:05:07,360 --> 01:05:09,600
He must also remember that

618
01:05:09,680 --> 01:05:12,680
it was I who cast him out.

619
01:05:12,760 --> 01:05:16,960
Then he ought to resent me
and report me to Lord Phop.

620
01:05:17,040 --> 01:05:20,600
Once informed, he would come to the
teahouse and give me a beating.

621
01:05:20,680 --> 01:05:21,800
But where?

622
01:05:22,560 --> 01:05:25,520
Where is he?
He has yet to give me a beating.

623
01:05:25,600 --> 01:05:30,200
I remember that 28 chairs were replaced.

624
01:05:30,280 --> 01:05:33,800
I counted them all
and noticed that two had broken legs.

625
01:05:33,880 --> 01:05:37,880
As for the vase,
this is the twentieth one.

626
01:05:37,960 --> 01:05:41,920
He even punched a hole clean
through the ceiling…

627
01:06:00,520 --> 01:06:03,080
Why is it so quiet tonight?

628
01:06:03,160 --> 01:06:04,440
Where's everyone?

629
01:06:04,520 --> 01:06:05,800
Today is the New Year.

630
01:06:06,760 --> 01:06:08,600
People are gathering at the temple.

631
01:06:09,840 --> 01:06:11,440
Kindly join me tomorrow.

632
01:06:12,000 --> 01:06:13,800
The festivities last for three days.

633
01:06:13,880 --> 01:06:15,080
You promise?

634
01:06:16,000 --> 01:06:19,280
If you're on duty,
you need to find a way to swap shifts.

635
01:06:35,480 --> 01:06:36,640
I promise.

636
01:06:38,040 --> 01:06:41,360
Now, rest.
You have been mischievous all day.

637
01:06:45,080 --> 01:06:46,280
Good night.

638
01:06:48,120 --> 01:06:49,400
Sweet dreams.

639
01:06:53,600 --> 01:06:54,680
No, no dreams.

640
01:06:56,440 --> 01:06:57,600
So we will sleep soundly

641
01:06:58,440 --> 01:07:00,200
and get a good rest.

642
01:07:03,200 --> 01:07:04,440
Goodnight and no dreams,

643
01:07:05,360 --> 01:07:06,360
you.

644
01:07:52,600 --> 01:07:53,600
<i>Klao!</i>

645
01:07:54,280 --> 01:07:55,320
<i>Where are you hiding?</i>

646
01:08:16,600 --> 01:08:18,240
Whither do you think to flee?

647
01:08:37,000 --> 01:08:38,439
-What?
-I had a nightmare.

648
01:08:47,960 --> 01:08:49,080
What about?

649
01:08:50,560 --> 01:08:52,399
You can tell me anything.

650
01:08:56,840 --> 01:08:57,920
<i>I can't.</i>

651
01:08:59,439 --> 01:09:02,920
<i>How am I supposed to tell you that Klao,</i>
<i>the one you love,</i>

652
01:09:04,000 --> 01:09:05,479
<i>has already been murdered?</i>

653
01:09:11,560 --> 01:09:12,560
Never mind it.

654
01:09:13,880 --> 01:09:15,640
Tell me whenever you feel ready.

655
01:09:27,840 --> 01:09:29,080
Tonight,

656
01:09:29,840 --> 01:09:31,200
might you share my bed?

657
01:10:13,840 --> 01:10:18,160
I simply wonder
how people go about courting another.

658
01:10:19,320 --> 01:10:22,480
<i>Klao, the one from our childhood, Phop?</i>

659
01:10:22,560 --> 01:10:23,920
Is it that odd?

660
01:10:24,000 --> 01:10:26,440
Are you not the same, or am I mistaken?

661
01:10:26,520 --> 01:10:29,560
<i>The servants said</i>
<i>you have yet to eat anything all day.</i>

662
01:10:29,640 --> 01:10:31,560
I have brought you your favorites.

663
01:10:31,640 --> 01:10:33,160
It is simply impossible.

664
01:10:33,240 --> 01:10:34,560
Then so be it.

665
01:10:34,640 --> 01:10:36,440
Pray tell me, my good physician,

666
01:10:37,040 --> 01:10:39,040
what am I to do?

667
01:10:39,560 --> 01:10:42,640
<i>Are you more worried about me</i>

668
01:10:43,760 --> 01:10:44,600
<i>or</i>

669
01:10:45,720 --> 01:10:48,240
<i>Klao, the one you knew?</i>

670
01:10:49,280 --> 01:10:51,400
<i>I believe you know in your heart</i>

671
01:10:51,480 --> 01:10:53,200
<i>how I feel about you.</i>
